CSS for subpad/run button. Add near `.mobile-menu-btn`:
```
.mobile-subpad { display:flex; gap:8px; pointer-events:none; }
.mobile-subpad > button { pointer-events:auto; }
.mobile-run-btn { width:42; height:42; border-radius:50%; border... font-family mono; font-size7; ...}
.mobile-run-btn.active { background gold; color dark; border-color...}
```
Also landscape sizes. And close button bigger on mobile: `.close-btn { width:40px;height:40px; }` in media. Let's add.

